@startuml
title SplitSmart system context — desktop MVP and complete product
actor "Individual / group member" as Member
actor Organizer
actor Approver
rectangle "SplitSmart Java Swing MVP\n(desktop implementation decision)" as MVP
rectangle "SplitSmart complete product\n(web + Android + iOS; shared data required)" as Product
cloud "Email / verification / recovery\nprovider TBD" as Identity
cloud "Notification delivery\nchannels TBD" as Notice
cloud "Private receipt storage\nprovider TBD" as Receipt
Member --> MVP : desktop access
Organizer --> MVP
Approver --> MVP
Member --> Product : web/mobile access
Organizer --> Product
Approver --> Product
Product --> Identity : proposed integration
Product --> Notice : proposed post-commit notices
Product --> Receipt : proposed private image storage
note bottom of MVP
No running implementation is verified.
Cannot satisfy required web/mobile coverage alone.
end note
@enduml
